msgstr "- [Dynamic import](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Operators/import) — модульдерді жүктеу.\n"
"- [Jotai stores](https://jotai.org/docs/core/store) — тәуелсіз runtime экземплярлары."

